    "scheme_concerns": [
      "VCM_BALANCED is a train-only subset of the older master, not a fresh independent corpus or holdout.",
      "MASTER and BALANCED share sources and many exact claimed hashes with frozen HUMAN views; frozen evaluation/calibration data must be excluded from any new training source by speaker and PCM identity.",
      "Source-specific speaker splits within MASTER are disjoint by literal declared IDs, but they are independent of the frozen study splits; the cross-study intersections are reported.",
      "MASTER source real is not an independent proof of consent/person identity; synthetic voices and noise groups must not count as people.",
      "BALANCED has 1467 pitch/speed/noise/gain/shift derivatives and 480 synthetic rows; these violate this study's original-human/no-augmentation arm.",
      "Ambient SILENCE clips are a separately identified non-speech rejection track, not human demographic samples.",
      "Multi-Sensor has four microphone recordings per explicit metadata utterance group; use one microphone recording per paired utterance and keep pairs/speakers together.",
      "Supplied reports flag retained exact duplicates, one synthetic gain derivative identical to its balanced original, and one near-silent LIGHT_OFF original; none is silently removed.",
      "Speaker ID prefixes are not demographic metadata; no gender/age/native-language sidecar is created from them.",
      "The 16-class ontology lacks COLOR, CALL, MESSAGE, reminder classes and absolute volume/brightness slots; it does not qualify the 19-intent model or complete selected catalog.",
      "MASTER UNKNOWN is relative to its older 16-class ontology. It must be reviewed against the current 19-intent/catalog definition before any row is adopted as OOV; missing intent/slot metadata cannot establish a current negative reference."
    ],
